00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,600
They're not easy to deploy.

319
00:17:40,601 --> 00:17:44,640
they're kind of dangerous sometimes for our officers as well.

320
00:17:44,740 --> 00:17:47,140
While they're an additional tool, they're not foolproof.

321
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:50,640
It's not the answer to everything.

