411
00:23:40,361 --> 00:23:45,960
The first kind of system works on with a radio frequency, and it is installed in your car.

412
00:23:46,080 --> 00:23:47,420
It works on triangulation.

413
00:23:49,020 --> 00:23:52,140
LoJack introduced its patented technology in 1986.

